# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for LOCAL development only.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# Admin access is enforced by Cloudflare Access (Zero Trust) at the edge, so no
# admin secrets are needed by the Functions. Product/order data lives in D1,
# which is configured via a local (git-ignored) wrangler.toml when running with
# `wrangler pages dev`.
#
# Provisioning the Access application (scripts/setup-access.mjs) is a one-off
# admin task run from your machine — put its API token in a local `.env`:
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=...   # Account → Access: Apps and Policies → Edit
#   CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=...  # optional; defaults to the Fold account